        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<p>Join us for an extraordinary 7-day retreat in the breathtaking paradise of Costa Rica, guided by two renowned experts in the field of E-motional Healing: Dr. Darren Weissman and Dr. Bradley Nelson.<br/><br/>Dr. Bradley Nelson and Dr. Darren Weissman are internationally acclaimed experts renowned for their holistic approach to understanding the intricate relationship between emotions and physical health. With decades of experience and a deep passion for personal development, they have helped countless individuals worldwide overcome emotional blocks and achieve lasting transformation. In a nurturing environment, they guide participants on a journey of self-discovery and empowerment.</p><p>Get ready to unlock the hidden potential within yourself and create a profound shift in your emotional well-being!</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
