    "rich_text_XR93g7": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_CCqdra": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Discover the Power of E-motional Healing",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_Q9PaM7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>Emotions play a significant role in our daily lives, influencing our thoughts, actions, and overall well-being. But what if you could harness the transformative energy of your emotions and use it for trauma healing, personal growth, and life’s challenges? That’s precisely what E-motional Healing is all about.</p><p>A groundbreaking approach that combines cutting-edge science, ancient wisdom, and practical techniques to help you release emotional baggage, break free from self-limiting patterns, and live a life of true authenticity and joy.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_CCqdra",
        "text_Q9PaM7"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "align_text": "center",
        "narrow_column": false,
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false
      }
    },
    "061b0d20-e98a-47d8-9f35-f44f31d51acc": {
      "type": "columns-2",
      "blocks": {
        "2916552a-4524-4aff-acbc-634e4afb6d00": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "The Resort",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The Occidental Papagayo is an adults-only resort and is part of the Barceló Hotel Group. It is situated on a stunning beach, surrounded by exceptional natural beauty. The biodiversity of this magnificent country is at your fingertips.</p><p>The hotel is conveniently located about 45 minutes from the Liberia airport. The location is ideal for enjoying the warm waters of the Pacific, in addition to being the perfect place for a retreat in paradise. It has a fabulous spa that offers endless therapeutic and beauty treatments.</p><p>The Occidental Papagayo is the perfect blend of relaxation and adventure, luxury and comfort, jungle and sea—a truly magical place just waiting to be discovered.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Occid-Papagayo.webp",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "bd48c292-e8fb-405b-9fc2-3e92ec363226": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Dining",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>There are three restaurants, four bars, and a snack bar that serve a variety of local and international dishes intended to satisfy the palate of every guest. All breakfasts, lunches, dinners, snacks, and drinks are included, as are alcoholic beverages after daily sessions are completed.<br/><br/><strong>L’Buffet</strong></p><p>This is the main restaurant that serves its meals buffet style. You will find a wide variety of food choices that are specifically designed to meet the dietary needs of all participants. Breakfast, lunch, and dinner will be served here daily.</p><p><strong>The Italian </strong></p><p>This boutique restaurant is open for dinner only and serves delicious pastas, pizzas, and other Italian delicacies. You will enjoy the cuisine and wines of this delicious restaurant in the midst of a tropical haven.</p><p><strong>D’Oriental Restaurant</strong></p><p>Enjoy thisJapanese and Asian fusion restaurant with private tatami rooms and a teppanyaki table. The dishes are exquisite and offer fresh, delicious choices of varieties of seafood and vegetables prepared with elegance and care to delight your palate.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/The-Italian-Restaurant.jpg",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "643bace9-4996-4be4-b931-2de728a157a3": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Spa",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>During this retreat, treat yourself to the luxurious offerings of the spa, available at your own cost. Enhance your body, mind, and spirit with soothing whirlpool baths, invigorating saunas, Vichy showers, Turkish baths, and private cabins for ultimate relaxation. Enjoy therapeutic treatments and facial massages designed to elevate your well-being.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Spa.jpg",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "aaa35b1a-8f7f-40b4-88b2-307c26dd6c43": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "World's Biggest Labyrinth",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>On one of the days, we’ll explore La Senda, the world’s biggest labyrinth. It is located in the middle of the dry tropical forest of Guanacaste and offers you a perfect gateway to another realm.</p><p>The labyrinth measures above 2.5 acres (over 1 hectare), and the path is almost 2 miles (3 km) long. It took 6 years to develop, and now it is fully planted with over 5,000 cacti. All sentient beings, like humans, animals, and plants in La Senda, constantly live under the upbeat influence of this big, pulsing heart of energy.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/labyrinth-aerial-min-1920x1288.jpg",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "cab40b70-71f5-4157-900c-344ccf2d5e06": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Yoga Classes",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Although this isn’t exclusively a yoga retreat, we offer optional yoga classes followed by breakfast on days 2, 3, 5, and 6 of our emotional wellness retreat. They’re a great way to practice your breathwork and be in the present moment.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/La-Senda-Yoga.jpg",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "3add13bf-0d42-4859-bb63-8001878aaaff": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Intensive Workshops",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Engage in profound workshops led by Dr. Bradley Nelson and Dr. Darren Weissman, where they will share their wisdom, insights, and practical techniques from the LifeLine Technique and the Emotion Code. These workshops will provide you with the tools and knowledge to transform your emotional landscape and create lasting change in your everyday life.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "ebdfe271-9b08-404d-b048-054040ddfafd": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Group Healing Sessions",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Experience the power of collective healing as you participate in group sessions facilitated by experts. Through the LifeLine Technique and the Emotion Code, you will have the opportunity to release emotional blocks, gain clarity, and cultivate a deep sense of inner peace.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "891e006f-618e-4b78-ba35-8dfacd4d4274": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Rejuvenation Activities",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Indulge in a variety of activities, such as excursions, spa treatments, beachside massages, poolside relaxation, jet skiing, and playing in the waves. These experiences are available at your own cost.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/2021-06-04.jpg",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        }
      },
