    "6a2fb62f-79e7-42de-acea-4e5fab243fb0": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "ced5bdc3-cbd0-4d38-8816-9d58a157be58": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Exclusions",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The cost does not include air-fare, optional excursions or spa treatments.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "88fe273d-dad8-4fcb-8e72-e298aeffea83": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Cancellation and Refunds",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>If you choose to cancel your participation in this retreat, we will not refund any deposits or subsequent payments, regardless of circumstances. Given this policy, we strongly suggest that you purchase travel insurance in case of emergencies or unforeseen circumstances.</p><p>Travel insurance will protect your investment in case of unforeseen situations or emergencies. If you choose to purchase travel insurance, which we highly recommend, you must do so on your own. We have been working with <a href=\"https://www.travelguard.com/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Travel Guard International</span></a> at 800-826-1300 and have received positive feedback. When you purchase this insurance, please take some time to double-check what is covered. Each state has slightly different policies. Be sure that you are getting coverage that includes a refund if the host of the retreat is unavailable to attend if you wish to apply that option.</p><p>In the unlikely event that Global Journeys Inc. is forced to cancel or postpone this retreat, we can apply the total amount you have paid towards a future retreat with Global Journeys within one year of the start date of this retreat, or you can receive a full refund.</p><p>If one of the presenters is not able to attend the event due to serious illness or emergency, the other presenter will deliver the sessions and the retreat will continue as scheduled. If both presenters are unable to attend, they will either choose an appropriate substitute or deliver the program virtually if possible.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "7095d1c2-5359-4f1f-a1e0-070d2644f848": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Disclosure",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Global Journeys Inc. offers various travel opportunities to the general public. Global Journeys Inc., its owners, and contracted personnel have taken what they believe to be reasonable precautions to create and conduct safe trips.</p><p>As a participant, you must recognize that any trip may have inherent dangers, including but not limited to flying on commercial airlines over U.S. land, other countries, and ocean waters; traveling in vehicles on crowded streets and mountain highways; swimming in pools without lifeguards; eating and drinking food that may be foreign and different from what you are normally used to; exposure to intense sun and hot, humid conditions; and encountering other unpredictable situations that may arise in Costa Rica. If you choose to participate in yoga sessions, please be responsible and move at your own pace. If you choose to swim, note that there is no lifeguard, so you are responsible for your swimming safety.</p><p>Your decision to participate in this retreat means that you are physically, mentally, and emotionally capable of safely handling this trip to Costa Rica. If you have any suspicion, no matter how slight, that you may have a physical or mental health condition that may prevent you from participating safely, it is your responsibility to seek medical treatment or consultation to verify whether you should participate. Please do not go on this trip if you do not believe you have the appropriate skills or physical/emotional/mental capabilities to safely participate. We highly recommend that you have medical insurance and bring your insurance card on the trip, as well as purchase travel insurance.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "36d254e6-c118-4eb9-868e-c7838412525e": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Insurance",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>We strongly suggest that you purchase travel insurance in case of emergencies or unforeseen circumstances that may arise. Travel insurance will protect your investment in case of unforeseen situations or emergencies. If you choose to purchase travel insurance, which we highly recommend, you must do so on your own. We have been working with <a href=\"https://www.travelguard.com/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Travel Guard International</span></a> at 800-826-1300 and have received positive feedback. When you purchase this insurance, please take some time to double-check what is covered. Each state has slightly different policies. Be sure that you are getting coverage that includes a refund if the host of the retreat is unavailable to attend if you wish to apply that option.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "8fef7e85-3dbd-4573-b556-4afbf969813d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Travel Booking Details",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Make flight reservations to fly into Liberia, Costa Rica (LIR). Schedule your flight to arrive in Liberia between 1 pm and 3 pm on December 1st, 2024. For your departure, schedule your flight to leave after 1 pm from the Liberia Airport (LIR) to your home airport on December 7th, 2024. If you arrive and depart within these time frames, we will cover your transportation costs. If you arrive and/or depart at different times, we are happy to help you with your transportation arrangements, but please note this will be at your own cost.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "92831aaa-ae05-420c-9600-67e471449e46": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Contact Rythmia",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Contact the Rythmia team directly at (833) 217-7032 anytime during their normal business hours (Monday - Friday 6 am - 6 pm PST, Saturday & Sunday 6am - 5pm PST).</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
